{"bundle_id":"search.bae4d8eb925077c5c750","facts":[{"description":"The actor making the assessed offer acts as a distributor in this promotional context, independently of who funds or fulfils the benefit.; units: Boolean classification of the offeror","name":"offeror_is_distributor","type":"bool"},{"description":"The assessed actor offers this benefit component to the identified client at the assessment time. Attribution of the offer must be established; funding, fulfilment, acceptance and payment are not prerequisites for this fact.; units: Boolean offering relation for one actor, component, client and time","name":"actor_offers_component_to_client","type":"bool"},{"description":"The assessed component is substantively classified as a gift under the quoted restriction, separately from the discount exception. Its being a guaranteed return or incentive alone does not establish this classification.; units: Boolean classification of one benefit component","name":"component_is_gift","type":"bool"},{"description":"The assessed component itself constitutes a discount of identifiable fees or charges. A discount in another component does not satisfy this fact.; units: Boolean exception classification of one benefit component","name":"component_is_fee_or_charge_discount","type":"bool"},{"description":"Offering this component promotes an identified specific investment product to the client.; units: Boolean promotional relation","name":"component_promotes_specific_product","type":"bool"},{"description":"Offering this component is linked to promoting a particular type of investment product, including certain fund types or funds offered by certain fund houses.; units: Boolean promotional relation","name":"component_promotes_product_type","type":"bool"}],"interpretations":[{"basis":"reviewer_interpretation","id":"reading","issue_ids":[],"source_span_ids":["s.db43e253bea18.u13.2987","s.db43e253bea18.u12.2646","s.db43e253bea18.u7.1360"],"statement":"Unreviewed interpretation: [TRU